  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your multitask ability can be used to simultaneously move your mind in two activities at the same time.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Improved Multitask, character level 9th.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Your semoxa bond strengthens and grows granting you the option of taking a standard action by using 3 of your daily uses of multitask. You also gain 2 additional daily uses of multitask.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/veryx#toc29\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
